  "documentation": {
    "content": "Check the internet connectivity of the cluster. \n\n1. The cluster vserver must be connected to global dns 8.8.8.8 and 8.8.4.4.\n\ndns show\n\n2. The name server status must be up.\n\ndns check -vserver <adminsvm> -name-server 8.8.8.8\n\ndns check -vserver <adminsvm> -name-server 8.8.4.4\n\n3. Below destinations must be listed.\n\nautosupport destinations show\n\nhttp://suppport.netapp.com/put/AsupPut\nhttp://suppport.netapp.com/asupprod/post/1.0/postAsup\n\n4. Once all the above issues are rectified, trigger a test ASUP.\n\nautosupport invoke -node * -type all -message \"TEST\"\n\n${metric_or_resource.labels}",
